;------------------------------------------------------------------------------
; *TUNE and SHIFT f4: SIGNAL-QUALITY TUNING SCREEN
; Clears control bit 4 so the TDA2541's AFC doesn't fight the manual tuning, then
; repeatedly measures reception over 25 fields:
;   ham_count  / ham_errors are incremented by the interrupt handler for every
;   Hamming byte decoded / found in error.
; The bar length is 32 * (1 - errors / bytes). With no bytes at all, "No teletext being
; received" is shown. The 20-character status message from the broadcast service data is
; shown when available. SPACE or ESCAPE leaves (AFC back on); any other key re-measures.
;------------------------------------------------------------------------------
.cmd_TUNE
