;------------------------------------------------------------------------------
; TELESOFTWARE COMMAND SUBROUTINE TABLE: 42 six-byte entries
;   3-letter name, flags, handler address (lo, hi)
; Flags: bit 7 = install at start-up; bits 0-3 = which pass the command runs in, bit 4 =
; "is a command". Entries using &AA0D are commands this decoder doesn't implement: they
; raise "Telesoftware error". The table is followed by the letters giving each command's
; default escaped name (&A7EC: "A v j i c ...").
;------------------------------------------------------------------------------
