    A844  60        RTS
;------------------------------------------------------------------------------
; DEFAULT NAME TABLES (the general Telesoftware format, manual table 9.2):
;   every lone name decodes to itself (kind 1, value = name)
;   every escaped name means <ESC> (kind &1B) until a command is installed below
;   lone &1B and &9B, escaped &7C and &FC are the escape operator
; Each installed command from the table at &A6EF is given the escaped name from &A7EC
; and the same name with bit 7 set (both parities).
;------------------------------------------------------------------------------
.ts_default_names
