; RAISE "Telesoftware error" with error number A, after resetting the decoder:
;   &C8 frame stack full   &C9 unexpected end   &CA bad name kind   &CB unknown command
;   &CC bad digit          &CD output queue full &CE page data error  &CF block out of sequence
; Commands this decoder doesn't implement point here, entered with A=&CB.
;------------------------------------------------------------------------------
.ts_error
